ging, topic config\n│   └── oak*.yaml                 # Per-camera configs\n└── scripts/\n    └── start_tmux_project11.bash # Startup script for gabby\n```\n\nNote: URDF lives in this package but is tracked by #25.\n\n## Key Differences from IzzyBoat\n\n| Aspect | IzzyBoat (160) | BizzyBoat (240) |\n|--------|---------------|-----------------|\n| Hull | EchoBoat 160 (1.75m × 0.8m) | EchoBoat 240 (larger) |\n| GNSS | PosMV + MAVRos fallback | CUAV C-RTK 2HP (MAVRos only) |\n| Cameras | 1× OAK + 1× USB + JoLo | 4× OAK-1 (PoE) + 1× factory USB |\n| Sonar | DeltaT + Norbit | DeltaT only |\n| Computer | ? | Nuvo 9160GC (gabby) |\n| Namespace | `izzy` | `bizzy` |\n| Frame prefix | `izzy/` | `bizzy/` |\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Package builds in `platforms_ws`\n- [ ] `bizzyboat_launch.py` launches base echoboat nodes + bizzy-specific sensors\n- [ ] UDP bridge configured with appropriate topics for 4 OAK cameras + DeltaT\n- [ ] Platform dimensions set for EchoBoat 240 hull (placeholder until #25)\n- [ ] Rosbag logging configured for bizzy topics\n- [ ] Network docs in `docs/` reference existing `bizzyboat_network.md`\n\n---\n**Authored-By**: `Claude Code Agent`\n**Model**: `Claude Opus 4.6`","files":null},{"type":6,"timestamp":1774625900,"nonce":"lFkVW/V0GNk4xGFL7s22SvzwxRE=","metadata":{"github-id":"UCE_lAHOK4fCvM72n54-zq2ha0c"},"target":"7afe294e19214993ecb59c27effbb83fd2e06704a428af9239c52ac6aeff8ab7","message":"## Summary\n\nCreate a `bizzyboat_project11` ROS 2 package for the BizzyBoat (EchoBoat 240), following the same pattern as `izzyboat_project11`.\n\nPart of #5 (original setup checklist — \"create a ros package similar to izzyboat_project11\").\n\n## Sub-Issues\n\n| # | Task | Repo |\n|---|------|------|\n| #25 | URDF with sensor frame positions + hull dimensions | rolker/unh_echoboats_project11 |\n| [CCOMJHC/ccomjhc_project11#9](https://github.com/CCOMJHC/ccomjhc_project11/issues/9) | OAK camera static IP assignments | CCOMJHC/ccomjhc_project11 |\n| #26 